{"reviews":[{"id":"B07MC84KMN-0","r":5.0,"t":"Pretty design, versatile & colorful.","x":"Very cute & of good quality. I braided one side as shown in the sellers pic to hold headbands. Works well, really like the design & versatility, my 5 yo loves it!","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B07MC84KMN-1","r":5.0,"t":"MAN IT'S MAGICAL","x":"Loved everything about this bow holder! I'm all about those well made and affordable products. Without a doubt worth the $10 you spend. It's well made and the material used looks and feels great, adorablely decked out and not at all heavy on your wall at all. The unicorn horn and flowers look so cute too! Everything is placed nice and neat and lacks any kind of \"cheap\" appearance.  The ONLY thing I plan on doing is gluing the sparkly gold glitter tip of the ears down onto the white. But that's o","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B07MC84KMN-2","r":5.0,"t":"Awesome Gift","x":"I bought this for my niece for her birthday.  I thought it would come in handy for all her Jojo bows. Well I thought right! She loved it!! Everyone asked me where I got. I recommend this for any little girl with or without bows. It was larger than I expected but in a good way. It's very pretty and can hang so many bows.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B07MC84KMN-3","r":5.0,"t":"Super cute!","x":"I bought this for my daughter\u2019s ever-expanding bow/hair clip collection. Hung it up prominently on the wall in her bathroom as decoration. Super, super cute and colorful! Absolutely love it!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B07MC84KMN-4","r":5.0,"t":"Lovely!","x":"Absolutely love it! It looks really cute. I got it because the other 2 my daughters have are full and we loved it.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B07MC84KMN-5","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful bow holder","x":"I ordered this bow holder for my 4 year old because she has a lot of bows! She loved it when she saw it and she had fun helping me put the bows on it. I would definitely recommend this product! It is exactly what I expected! It\u2019s made well and is the perfect size! The length of the strips of fabric are just right!  This bow holder is a great deal for the price!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B07MC84KMN-6","r":5.0,"t":"Love it!","x":"I got my girls one each, they have so many accessories and everything as is shown in the picture works and attaches to it! This speeds up the morning getting ready as they can just go grab what they want for the day instead of digging in a basket! Great idea!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2019"},{"id":"B07MC84KMN-7","r":5.0,"t":"Looks great and my girls love it!","x":"This is the second holder I had to purchase for my daughters and has helped to split up the many bows, headbands, and other. My daughters love it and enjoy taking off and putting on the holder. Highly recommend for hair accessories and for younger kids.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B07MC84KMN-8","r":5.0,"t":"Absolutely gorgeous","x":"Absolutely gorgeous! Initially I ordered one because I wasn\u2019t sure it was going to look like the picture or even work at all. After receiving it I ordered 2 more to give as gifts. Looks amazing and it does the job! Very pleased;)","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B07MC84KMN-9","r":1.0,"t":"Surprise! Wrong one","x":"As much as I think it's pretty, it's nothing like the photo. Maybe the warehouse just grabbed from the wrong bin by mistake but I saw another review recieved the same wrong dream catcher. Still disappointed when I received it.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B07MC84KMN-10","r":4.0,"t":"It's pretty","x":"Really pretty doesn't display the bows as nicely as I thought, if you put to many on it. But it does hold a lot of bows and other things. I would buy it just to put on the wall without any bows, it really is that pretty.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B07MC84KMN-11","r":5.0,"t":"Super cute!","x":"Really cute! I would buy it again if anything happened to it. Really soft, with vibrant colors. My daughter loves unicorns and dream catchers and adores the fact she can keep her hair bows on it!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B07MC84KMN-12","r":5.0,"t":"SO CUTE!","x":"Absolutely love this bow holder I got for all of my daughter's bows. The material that hangs is very light so a normal bow has to be clipped to 2-4 pieces. But, it is so incredibly adorable.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B07MC84KMN-13","r":5.0,"t":"Sweet","x":"Absolutely stunning best ever I bought one for my daughter(first photo) And one for my niece deff worth every penny extremely sturdy and very well made would recommend over and over","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B07MC84KMN-14","r":5.0,"t":"Great, made to last!","x":"This is a cute fun way to add to the decor along with help to keep any kind of hair accessory hidden in plain site without creating a messy look. It\u2019s also budget friendly!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B07MC84KMN-15","r":3.0,"t":"Not the right one!!","x":"Very pretty and will work for my daughter's bows,  but what I wanted was not what I got. I ordered the one in the picture but I ended up with a different one all together.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B07MC84KMN-16","r":5.0,"t":"Just hit the \"one click buy\" you wont regret this purchase !","x":"It's so pretty and soft , like tshirt tye dye material. My daughter absolutely loves it shes braiding some of the strands as I write this. Extremely well made \ud83d\ude0d","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B07MC84KMN-17","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful","x":"This is SO cute and beautiful. Such good quality for the price. So glad I made this purchase. My 5 year old loves it and it is the perfect addition to her room.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B07MC84KMN-18","r":5.0,"t":"Love it","x":"This is absolutely adorable! Perfect for holding my daughter\u2019s bows. It\u2019s actually bigger than expected, which is nice. Great value for the price!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B07MC84KMN-19","r":5.0,"t":"So adorable!","x":"Absolutely adorable and fits alot of bows. We have about 10 of the big Jojo bows and alot of smaller ones and still have plenty of room for more!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B07MC84KMN-20","r":1.0,"t":"No es como en la imagen.","x":"No llego lo que ped\u00ed. Fue completamente diferente a lo de la foto. Y cuando fui a poner los mo\u00f1os no funcion\u00f3. Perdida total del dinero.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B07MC84KMN-21","r":5.0,"t":"Cute!","x":"My daughter absolutely loves this! The colors are bright and pretty and the whole thing is just soft and cute. Lots of room for bows.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B07MC84KMN-22","r":5.0,"t":"Awesome","x":"My daughter is so excited she absolutely loves it. It was bigger then I thought which is perfect considering she has over 100 bows!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B07MC84KMN-23","r":5.0,"t":"Good choice","x":"Very sturdy. We put a total of 30 bows on it and it has held up for every since. It looks good and works well so no complaints.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B07MC84KMN-24","r":5.0,"t":"Definitely a great buy!","x":"Bought as a gift for a 1st birthday. Mom and baby both loved the gift! Item is made well and looks exactly like the picture.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently describe the holder as cute, pretty, and colorful, and many say their daughters love it.","cites":[1,3,4,5,6,8,12,13,15]},{"text":"Many reviewers praise the build quality and value, calling it well made, sturdy, and worth the money.","cites":[1,2,6,14,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers say it works well for organizing a large collection of bows and hair accessories, sometimes speeding up getting ready.","cites":[3,6,7,8,11]},{"text":"A few reviewers note that the hanging fabric strips are light, so bows may need to be clipped across multiple strips or the holder can look cluttered when too full.","cites":[11,13]},{"text":"One reviewer received a wrong item that did not match the photo.","cites":[10]}]},"qa":[]}